WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.456 --> 00:00:10.752
The main reason we advise wedding parents to be careful with coffee and drinks on the day is how inconvenient using the restroom becomes.

2
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:15.048
Just as a bride in her dress hesitates before even a sip of water,

3
00:00:15.384 --> 00:00:23.856
the wedding parents in layered underskirts and a full hanbok skirt find the whole restroom process cumbersome and time-consuming.

4
00:00:24.192 --> 00:00:31.440
It's essentially impossible to step away right before the ceremony or during the busy lobby greeting time,

5
00:00:31.776 --> 00:00:36.648
so it's best to keep fluid intake to just enough to wet your mouth.

6
00:00:36.984 --> 00:00:44.736
Caffeine-heavy coffee also raises an already nervous heart rate and, being a diuretic, makes bathroom trips more likely.

7
00:00:45.072 --> 00:00:55.056
If you need a drink for thirst or fatigue, always use a straw to keep lip makeup from smudging on the cup or bleeding around your mouth, and only take a small amount.

8
00:00:55.392 --> 00:00:59.952
And be sure to use the restroom before putting on the hanbok — it helps a lot.
